+// same problem the other way round (darkplaces/gl_rmain.c:53): it leaves the
+// camera at 46 units and ships vr_worldscale 26.2467 = 39.37/1.5, i.e. it grows
+// the world by 1.5x until 46 units IS 1.75 m. Feed 26.25 into the formula above
+// and the rise comes out ~0 — the donor's configuration falls out of ours as a
+// special case, so a player who prefers a big world just drags World Scale down
