+hull's own head, and a 56-unit-tall corridor would put it inside the ceiling
+brush, rendering the world from inside solid. Trace up and stop short. Falling is
+instant (being inside a wall for even one frame is a visible defect); rising back
+is eased, because a camera that snaps upward in VR is the one motion the head
